<title>JAPAN: Yaesu Musen -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yaesu Musen -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.69		vs	    7.03</p>
<p> Operating	 prft 72 million	  vs   loss 148    million</p>
<p> Current	   prft 97 million	  vs   loss 228    million</p>
<p> Net		 prft 84 million	  vs   loss 239    million</p>
<p> EPS	    prft 11.83 yen	  vs    loss 33.51 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	     -		vs		--</p>
<p>NOTE - Yaesu Musen Co Ltd is a wireless communications equipment maker.</p>
